            <description><![CDATA[<h2>FrameCast 1.0.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Fewer permission prompts at the start.</strong> The welcome tour now asks only for capture access. FrameCast asks for the rest the first time you need it: Screen Recording when you pick iPhone Mirroring, and the microphone when you first record with device sound.</li>
  <li><strong>Tell us what to build.</strong> Found a bug or missing a feature? Choose Help &gt; Send Feedback. We read everything.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
